OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over violence against
OL,4,Awomen and girls plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigner Poppy Murray said the
OL,7,Fstrategy was a "step in the right
OL,8,Fdirection", but she raised concerns
OL,9,Fincluding it being based on "very
OL,10,Flimited data".
